# No application API key, password, or database URL is required for the current
# Sites deployment. Sites provisions the persistent R2 binding named BUCKET.
# The workbook is not stored in .env or GitHub.
# Optional GitHub Actions Cloudflare deployment requires these repository settings:
# Secret: CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN (Workers deployment and R2 permissions)
# Variable: CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID
# Never put their actual values in this file or commit a .env file.
